@baseUrl = http://localhost:5113

### List active courses (requires an authenticated Student session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses
Accept: application/json

### Get active course details (requires an authenticated Student session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/1
Accept: application/json

### Inactive or unknown course returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses/2147483647
Accept: application/json